        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World’s Most Sinister Spot-the-Difference Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a convict serving your sentence. On the day your time is up, a strange ritual begins—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological thriller where you hunt down and shoot the hidden “differences” lurking across seven stages, confronting your own sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fusion of Spot-the-Difference and Shooting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just clicking—pulling the trigger itself becomes an act that shakes your psyche.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Differences with Each Playthrough</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout shifts every time, enhancing replayability and letting you uncover new horrors again and again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Collision of Guilt and Release</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desperation of failing to find the answers, the catharsis of each shot, and, in the end, the truth that awaits you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot down every difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But can you really say that makes it right?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World’s Most Sinister Spot-the-Difference Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a convict serving your sentence. On the day your time is up, a strange ritual begins—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological thriller where you hunt down and shoot the hidden “differences” lurking across seven stages, confronting your own sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fusion of Spot-the-Difference and Shooting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just clicking—pulling the trigger itself becomes an act that shakes your psyche.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Differences with Each Playthrough</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout shifts every time, enhancing replayability and letting you uncover new horrors again and again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Collision of Guilt and Release</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desperation of failing to find the answers, the catharsis of each shot, and, in the end, the truth that awaits you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot down every difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But can you really say that makes it right?</p>",
